      "beat_id": "A1",
      "act": "ACT 1",
      "narration_text": "ART_QC=1 turns the gates on. By default they are on. ART_QC=0 skips them — useful when you are in a previz pass and do not want the gates to block an obviously incomplete slate cut. For any final cut, the gates must be on and passing.",
